invite.body:
Hello,

We've opened the next wave of the e-invoicing beta and you're in it. Your invitation code:

{code}

How to use it:
1. Open WE Invoice: {appUrl}
2. Go to Settings, E-invoicing, Invitation code.
3. Choose your e-invoicing provider (digitálny poštár), register them with the Financial Administration at vpds.financnasprava.sk and paste in your API key.

Receiving e-invoices is free with several providers. If you run into a problem, reply to this e-mail; during the beta we read every message.

No longer interested in the beta? Unsubscribe here: {unsubscribeUrl}

White Eagles & Co. s. r. o., Bohrova 1194/1, 851 01 Bratislava
